        "response": {
          "capability": "knowledge",
          "status": "answered",
          "answer": "Framework guidance: \"RESPOND (RS): Actions regarding a detected cybersecurity incident are taken\" [NIST.CSWP.29.pdf, p. 27] (E_45eebff5cd2b40b6879df1161f0d7452)\n\nFramework guidance: \"\u2022 Incident Management (RS.MA): Responses to detected cybersecurity incidents are managed\" [NIST.CSWP.29.pdf, p. 27] (E_45eebff5cd2b40b6879df1161f0d7452)\n\nFramework guidance: \"RS.MA-01: The incident response plan is executed in coordination with relevant third parties once an incident is declared\" [NIST.CSWP.29.pdf, p. 27] (E_45eebff5cd2b40b6879df1161f0d7452)\n\nFramework guidance: \"RS.MA-05: The criteria for initiating incident recovery are applied\" [NIST.CSWP.29.pdf, p. 27] (E_45eebff5cd2b40b6879df1161f0d7452)\n\nFramework guidance: \"\u2022 Incident Analysis (RS.AN): Investigations are conducted to ensure effective response and support forensics and recovery activities\" [NIST.CSWP.29.pdf, p. 27] (E_45eebff5cd2b40b6879df1161f0d7452)",
